    "name": "Shinehill",
    "steam_appid": 1889890,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/1529d955416f9097a19ad00646cfd91b.avif?t=1754230254\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being a spy on an unfamiliar planet, anyone would have been greeted with hostility, but you were incredibly lucky! Trusting locals mistook you for a new neighbor and provided you with a house and a plot of land to live on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/0733024b551b1d2cf45e15688bdf6d97.poster.avif?t=1754230254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/0733024b551b1d2cf45e15688bdf6d97.webm?t=1754230254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You'll have to help out the locals: learn their stories, make &quot;friends&quot; or even something more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Win favour of the villagers, impress them with your achievements.</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Become a champion fisherman by showing patience and wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Engage in farming and grow various crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Descend and explore the long-abandoned dungeons that hide secrets of the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Show off your culinary skills by cooking flavourful dishes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/b228c458ab560392af7a3bc79c71bf54.poster.avif?t=1754230254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/b228c458ab560392af7a3bc79c71bf54.webm?t=1754230254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What drew attention of the command to this planet? Is this really a paradise island, or is its allure merely a deceptive facade?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know your new friends better and find the one who really holds a threat to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/f7d61aaf101548cedcbbcc3bffe64b10.avif?t=1754230254\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/1529d955416f9097a19ad00646cfd91b.avif?t=1754230254\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being a spy on an unfamiliar planet, anyone would have been greeted with hostility, but you were incredibly lucky! Trusting locals mistook you for a new neighbor and provided you with a house and a plot of land to live on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/0733024b551b1d2cf45e15688bdf6d97.poster.avif?t=1754230254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/0733024b551b1d2cf45e15688bdf6d97.webm?t=1754230254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You'll have to help out the locals: learn their stories, make &quot;friends&quot; or even something more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Win favour of the villagers, impress them with your achievements.</h2></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Become a champion fisherman by showing patience and wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Engage in farming and grow various crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Descend and explore the long-abandoned dungeons that hide secrets of the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Show off your culinary skills by cooking flavourful dishes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/b228c458ab560392af7a3bc79c71bf54.poster.avif?t=1754230254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/b228c458ab560392af7a3bc79c71bf54.webm?t=1754230254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What drew attention of the command to this planet? Is this really a paradise island, or is its allure merely a deceptive facade?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know your new friends better and find the one who really holds a threat to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/f7d61aaf101548cedcbbcc3bffe64b10.avif?t=1754230254\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Yet again they dumped the toughest job on you. Now you are on a Shinehill Island, where you suddenly replaced one of the new residents. Explore the world, meet charming townspeople, do farming, fishing, cooking and try not to reveal yourself.",
